  <content>
  <section><para>Here is the graph of this system of inequalities. Which of the following ordered pairs falls within the solution set?</para>
<figure><media alt="y is less than or equal to negative three-halves x plus thirty-four fourths and y is greater than two-sevenths x plus twenty-"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/f20e623c0948dffcb657171e551e097f14fe4e09"/></media></figure><div class="editor-indent">
  <para>\(6x\;+\;4y\;\leq\;34\)</para>
  <para>\(-2x\;+\;7y\;&gt;\;22\)</para>
</div></section>
</content>
